PROJECT Newsroom

DATABASE SQLITE

AUTH JWT

USE auth.roles

MODEL Article
    title STRING
    body TEXT

MODEL Section
    name STRING UNIQUE

RELATION User HAS_MANY Article

VALIDATE password REQUIRED MIN 8

ROUTE GET /articles
ROUTE POST /articles
ROUTE PATCH /articles/{id}
ROUTE DELETE /articles/{id}
ROUTE POST /sections ROLE admin editor
ROUTE DELETE /sections/{id} ROLE admin
ROUTE GET /users
ROUTE GET /reports/summary ROLE admin
